      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ULTRA PUB RUN (3) had the drop on the lead from the squeeze box before taking over turning, drawing clear to score (22.40) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Expected to be right there at the finish again. PAW QUANTUM (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 5th (24.71) at Sale. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. LEKTRA STING (7) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (22.89) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. MIDNIGHT REBEL (4) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
